        "en": "FP8 can significantly increase KV capacity, but requires support from the model and engine version",
        "zh": "FP8 可显著增加 KV 容量，但需模型与引擎版本支持"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "kv_offloading_size",
      "flag": "--kv-offloading-size",
      "label": {
        "en": "KV Offload to Memory",
        "zh": "KV Offload 到内存"
      },
      "type": "number",
      "control": "tier",
      "group": "performance",
      "min": 1,
      "step": 1,
      "help": {
        "en": "Total memory-tier capacity across all GPUs in GiB, not capacity per GPU",
        "zh": "所有 GPU 的内存层总量（GiB），不是每卡容量"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 20
    },
    {
      "key": "kv_disk_offload",
      "flag": "--kv-transfer-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "KV Offload to Disk",
        "zh": "KV Offload 到磁盘"
      },
      "type": "boolean",
      "control": "tier",
      "group": "performance",
      "default": false,
      "help": {
        "en": "The disk tier is relayed through the memory tier, so configure the memory tier first",
        "zh": "磁盘层经内存层中转，必须先配置内存层"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "depends_on": "kv_offloading_size",
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 21
    },
    {
      "key": "shared_kv_dir",
      "flag": "--kv-transfer-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Shared KV Directory",
        "zh": "共享 KV 目录"
      },
      "type": "string",
      "control": "path",
      "group": "performance",
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "/data/gpuworks/kv-cache",
        "zh": "/data/gpuworks/kv-cache"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "The platform creates and mounts a managed host directory at this container path, and keeps it inside the disk tier capacity.",
        "zh": "平台会在该容器路径挂载一个受管宿主机目录，并把它控制在磁盘层容量上限之内。"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "depends_on": "kv_disk_offload",
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "kv_offload_read_threads",
      "flag": "--kv-transfer-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Disk Read Threads",
        "zh": "磁盘读取线程"
      },
      "type": "integer",
      "control": "number",
      "group": "performance",
      "default": 16,
      "min": 1,
      "step": 1,
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "depends_on": "kv_disk_offload",
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 23
    },
    {
      "key": "kv_offload_write_threads",
      "flag": "--kv-transfer-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Disk Write Threads",
        "zh": "磁盘写入线程"
      },
      "type": "integer",
      "control": "number",
      "group": "performance",
      "default": 16,
      "min": 1,
      "step": 1,
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "depends_on": "kv_disk_offload",
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "kv_disk_limit_gib",
      "flag": "",
      "label": {
        "en": "Disk Tier Capacity (GiB)",
        "zh": "磁盘层容量上限（GiB）"
      },
      "type": "number",
      "control": "number",
      "group": "performance",
      "min": 1,
      "step": 1,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "Twice the model weights",
        "zh": "模型权重的两倍"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Ceiling the platform enforces on the disk tier directory; the engine has no such limit. Leave empty to let the platform derive it from the model weights.",
        "zh": "平台对磁盘层目录施加的容量上限，引擎自身没有上限。留空则由平台按模型权重推导。"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "automatic": true,
      "depends_on": "kv_disk_offload",
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 25
    },
    {
      "key": "enforce_eager",
      "flag": "--enforce-eager",
      "label": {
        "en": "Enforce Eager Mode",
        "zh": "强制 Eager"
      },
      "type": "boolean",
      "control": "switch",
      "group": "performance",
      "default": false,
      "help": {
        "en": "Starts faster and uses less GPU memory, but reduces steady-state decoding performance",
        "zh": "启动更快且更省显存，但会降低稳态解码性能"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 35
    },
    {
      "key": "speculative_algorithm",
      "flag": "--speculative-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Speculative Decoding Algorithm",
        "zh": "投机解码算法"
      },
      "type": "string",
      "control": "combobox",
      "group": "speculative",
      "enum": [
        "eagle",
        "eagle3",
        "mtp",
        "ngram",
        "draft_model",
        "dflash",
        "dspark"
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "eagle",
          "label": {
            "en": "EAGLE",
            "zh": "EAGLE"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "eagle3",
          "label": {
            "en": "EAGLE 3",
            "zh": "EAGLE 3"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "mtp",
          "label": {
            "en": "MTP",
            "zh": "MTP"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "ngram",
          "label": {
            "en": "N-gram",
            "zh": "N-gram"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "draft_model",
          "label": {
            "en": "Draft Model",
            "zh": "Draft 模型"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "dflash",
          "label": {
            "en": "DFlash",
            "zh": "DFlash"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "dspark",
          "label": {
            "en": "DSpark",
            "zh": "DSpark"
          }
        }
      ],
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "Choose an algorithm",
        "zh": "选择算法"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "For vLLM the list is only suggestions: type any method name the engine supports and it is passed as written; whether the chosen image supports it is yours to check. For SGLang, choose from the list. For an algorithm that needs a draft, such as DFlash, mount a registered model under Extra Mounts and enter its container path as the draft model.",
        "zh": "vLLM 的列表只是建议，可直接输入引擎支持的任意方法名，原样传给引擎，所选镜像是否支持由部署者自行确认；SGLang 只能从列表中选择。DFlash 等需要 draft 的算法，可在“额外挂载”中挂载一个已注册模型，再把它的容器路径填到 Draft 模型。"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ],
      "layout": "quick",
      "order": 32
    },
    {
      "key": "speculative_draft_model",
      "flag": "--speculative-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Draft Model",
        "zh": "Draft 模型"
      },
      "type": "string",
      "control": "text",
      "group": "speculative",
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "Container path, such as /draft for a model mounted under Extra Mounts; or a model ID",
        "zh": "容器内路径，例如在额外挂载中挂载的模型 /draft；或模型 ID"
      },
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "speculative_tokens",
      "flag": "--speculative-config",
      "label": {
        "en": "Speculative Tokens per Step",
        "zh": "每步投机 Token 数"
      },
      "type": "integer",
      "control": "number",
      "group": "speculative",
      "min": 1,
      "step": 1,
      "engines": [
        "vllm"
      ]
    },
